   "theory": "Gas leakage\n\nIn homes gas pipes and stoves often leak. In winter people put gas heaters in rooms and then forget to turn them off, from which gas leaks and spreads in the whole room; during this, on striking a matchstick or turning on an electric switch, fire breaks out with an explosion.\n\nChildren playing with things that start fire\n\nOften children are playing with matches or lighters etc., and they light the matches and throw them, from which there is a danger of fire.\n\nInflammable things\n\nIf fuel, paint, gunpowder and other things are stored carelessly, these become explosive. These things become the cause of an explosion, from which fire breaks out.\n\nDecoration items\n\nNowadays lights that give light in different colours from electricity are available. Their wires are fine and delicate. If these wires pass near things that catch fire, they quickly catch fire.",
