   "theory": "Electrical appliances\n\nIn homes, buildings and schools electrical appliances are installed. Because of old and rotten electric wires they can become the cause of an accident at any time. Check the electric wiring to see that they do not get hot on load. If they get hot on load, change them and install good quality. For things with more load such as freezer, refrigerator, oven, iron etc., power plugs should be installed.\n\nCandle\n\nA candle too becomes the cause of fire through carelessness, because the flame of a candle is open. If going out of the room, extinguish the candle. Leaving a candle burning in the room is inviting danger or an accident. At night while sleeping do not leave the candle burning. Besides this, keep things that start fire, e.g. matches, lighters etc., out of the reach of children.\n\nProtective guideline for protection from fire\n\nPolicy for protection from fire\n\nPolicies should be made for buildings for protection from fire. These policies should be strictly implemented, and in this regard no concession of any kind should be given.\n\nFacilities should be kept in the building according to the law.\n\nThe necessary measures related to protection from fire should have been taken in the building.",
