   "content": "<p>Medical aid</p><p>Encourage the patient.</p><p>Tie some bandage firmly between the heart and the wound.</p><p>Where there are tooth marks, take out blood and poison from there.</p><p>If necessary, suck the poison through the mouth on the tooth marks and spit it out; take care that the one doing so has no blisters in the mouth.</p><p>Immediately take the patient to hospital.</p><p>Sleeping pills</p><p>Sometimes some person uses these pills in a large quantity, from which there is danger to his life. Medical aid should be given to him immediately so that his life may be saved.</p><p>Medical aid</p><p>The patient should not be allowed to sleep.</p><p>Sprinkle water on the face of the patient, or wet a towel and keep it behind the neck.</p><p>Vomiting should be induced immediately.</p><p>Keep the courage of the patient high.</p>",
