   "content": "<p>Exercise questions</p><p>1. Choose and write the suitable answers.</p><p>i The angle of the sector of the discus throw is ________ degrees.</p><p>(a) 34.92  (b) 40.0  (c) 35  (d) 35.92</p><p>ii The inner diameter of the circle of the discus throw is ________ metres.</p><p>(a) 2.50  (b) 1.50  (c) 3.50  (d) 1.75</p><p>iii In the discus throw, if there are fewer than eight players, then ________ turns are given.</p><p>(a) 3  (b) 2  (c) 1  (d) 6</p><p>iv The discus falling outside the sector is ________ .</p><p>(a) a mistake  (b) a repeat turn  (c) disqualification  (d) correct</p><p>v In the discus throw there are ________ ways of gripping the discus.</p><p>(a) one  (b) two  (c) three  (d) four</p><p>vi For the 1500-metre race there are no regular ________ .</p><p>(a) ground  (b) rules  (c) lanes  (d) uniform</p><p>vii The 1500-metre race is run on a ________ -metre standard track.</p><p>(a) 200  (b) 400  (c) 600  (d) 800</p><p>2. Write the answers to the following questions.</p><p>i Make the sector of the discus and record the fouls.</p><p>ii Record the rules of the discus throw.</p><p>iii Make a score sheet for finding the positions of 6 players in the discus throw.</p><p>iv State the rules and fouls of the 1500-metre race.</p>",
