   "theory": "The in field consists of 4 bases, while the out field is the area outside the in-field bases, which is shown by 2 foul lines. In the in field there are 4 bases (Bases), of which one is called the home base (Home base). The home base is made of rubber consisting of 5 corners, while the remaining 3 bases are made of white canvas bags.\n\nEquipment and dress\n\nBat\n\nThe bat is made of wood and is round in shape. Its diameter at no part is more than 2.75 inches. The place of holding the bat is called the holding end (Holding End), whose length is at most 12 inches. The maximum length of the bat is 42 inches and the weight 940 grams.\n\nBall\n\nThe inner layer of the ball is made of cork, while the outer layer is of leather or wound yarn (wound yarn). Its weight is at most 148.8 grams and at least 141.7 grams.\n\nDress of the players\n\nHelmet for the batter (Batter's Helment)\n\nFace mask for the catcher (Catcher) (Face Mask)\n\nChest protector (Chest Protector)\n\nKeeper gloves (Keeper gloves)\n\nKnee and shin guard (Knee and Shin guard)",
